  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nIf you are sitting in a station while using the desktop camera and are pressing `Right Click` to move your view, you are only allowed to look up and down and not right to left (you can only rotate on the y axis)\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Go into a station (e.g. a chair)\n2. Open your Desktop Camera\n3. Press `Right Click` and try to look to the right or left\nIf you do this you will notice that you are only able to look up and down, but not left and right.\n# Attachments: \nHere is a video of me showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/bdtfch",
